+/*
+ * IOSurface presenter (COCOA_GL_PRESENT=iosurface; the default is the
+ * CAOpenGLLayer path).  Guest frames are copied into one of a few IOSurfaces
+ * on the QEMU thread as soon as the guest flushes them, and the main thread
